@startuml 08-delivery-self-claim-activity
' SRS Delivery Management - UC26 View Deliveries, UC27 Update Delivery Status,
' UC28 View Delivery Detail, UC29 Report Delivery Issue, UC30 Collect & Hand Over COD
' Redesign: shippers claim READY orders themselves from a shared pool (no manual Admin assignment)
title Online Delivery with Shipper Self-Claim (UC26-UC30)

|Customer|
start
:Place online order with delivery address;
if (Payment method?) then (Online gateway)
  |System|
  :Gateway callback SUCCESS\n-> payments SUCCESS, orders CONFIRMED;
else (COD)
  |System|
  :payments CASH PENDING (COD-<order code>)\n-> orders CONFIRMED;
endif

|Barista|
:Prepare drinks: CONFIRMED -> PREPARING;
:Mark order done -> READY;

|System|
:Order enters the "Waiting orders" pool\n(ONLINE + address, READY, no deliveries record yet);

|Shipper|
:Step 1 "Claim": open waiting orders\n(oldest first, page auto-refreshes every 30 s);
:Click "Claim & deliver" while at the store;
|System|
:Lock the order row (SELECT ... FOR UPDATE);
if (Order still READY and unclaimed?) then (no)
  :Show "Order already claimed by another shipper";
  stop
else (yes)
  :INSERT deliveries (status DELIVERING, cod_amount,\naccepted_at = picked_up_at = now)\norders -> DELIVERING, orders.shipper_id;
endif

|Shipper|
:Step 2 "Deliver & collect": take the order to the customer\n(phone number and address shown on the order card);
if (Delivery problem?\n(unreachable, wrong address, customer refuses...)) then (yes)
  :Report issue: type + description (UC29);
  |System|
  :INSERT delivery_issues;
  note right: Admin follows up and contacts the customer
  stop
else (no)
endif

if (COD order?) then (yes)
  |Shipper|
  :Collect cash, tick "I collected the full COD amount";
  |System|
  if (Box ticked?) then (no)
    :Reject: tick the box first\n(report an issue if the customer did not pay in full);
    stop
  else (yes)
    :payments COD -> SUCCESS\n+ earn Aura points for the customer (once);
  endif
else (no - paid online)
endif
|System|
:deliveries -> DELIVERED, orders -> COMPLETED;

|Shipper|
if (Holding COD cash?) then (yes)
  :Step 3 "Hand over COD": give all cash to a Cashier (UC30);
  |System|
  :Set cod_handed_over_at + cod_receiver_id\nfor every unsettled COD delivery;
else (no)
endif
stop
@enduml
